{"text": "PHILIP MORRIS INTERNATIONAL INC.\n\nINTER-OFFICE CORRESPONDENCE\n\n\u2018GOO WESTCHESTER AVENUE, RYE BROOK, NEW YORK 105731301\n\nTo: Distribution patiganuary 6, 1993\nFROM: Anne Okoniewski \u20142<\u2014\u2014~\nsusECE: EPA Release of Final Report\n\nThe Environmental Protection Agency (EPA) has scheduled a\nnews conference on January 7, 1993, in order to announce the\nrelease of the final version of the risk assessment on ETS.\n\nAttached for your information and use are the following:\n\nPM USA official press statement,\nStatement of Steve Parrish,\nPM discussion points,\nThe Tobacco Institute\u2019s \"Tobacco Update,\"\nrecent press clips regarding the EPA\u2019s announcement.\n\nIf you have any further questions, please let me know.\n\n/Attachments\nDISTRIBUTIO! PMCs\nD. Bushong\nPM EEMA D. Greenberg\n8. Carlson P. Maglione\nP. Grandjean S. Murray\nT. Johansen M. Parsons\nM. Nas G. Wirz\nG. Nassif\nA. White\nPM ASIA\nPM AUSTRALIA \u00a2. Goddard\nP. Francis J. Goodheart (Japan)\nR. Hodgson D. Harris\nPM LATIN AMERICA cc: T. Andrade\nA. Gonzalez Dr. T. Borelli\nM. Muse D. Dennis\nCc. Rodriguez D. Keane\nL. Pressl\nc. Purcell\nDr. H. Reif\nM. Winokur\n\n9ss9tToosz",
